<title>SINGAPORE: Indonesia details October LSWR loading schedule.</title>
<headline>Indonesia details October LSWR loading schedule.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's state oil company, Pertamina has announced the loading schedule for its 3.8 million barrels of low sulphur waxy residue (LSWR) for lifting in October, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The details of the October loading schedule are as follows (in thousand barrels):</p>
<p>LOADING FROM FLOATING STORAGE PLATINUM (OFF SUMATRA)</p>
<p>    TIMING	VOLUME	 COMPANY</p>
<p>Oct    3-5	   290	 British Petroleum (BP)</p>
<p>	 3-5	   150	 Indoil</p>
<p>	 3-5	    60	 Perta</p>
<p>     10-12	   500	 Perta</p>
<p>     18-20	   200	 BP</p>
<p>     18-20	   200	 Indoil</p>
<p>     25-27	   210	 BP</p>
<p>     25-27	   100	 Kipco</p>
<p>     25-27	    90	 Indoil</p>
<p>    SUB-TOTAL:   1,800</p>
<p>LOADING FROM PAKNING (SUMATRA)</p>
<p>     17-19	   200	 Pacific Petroleum</p>
<p>    LOADING FROM DUMAI    (SUMATRA)</p>
<p>	 5-7	   100	 Itochu</p>
<p>	 5-7	   100	 Kipco</p>
<p>     16-18	   140	 Far East Investment (FEI)</p>
<p>     16-18	    60	 Pacific Petroleum</p>
<p>     28-30	   200	 BP</p>
<p>    SUB-TOTAL:     600</p>
<p>LOADING FROM SAMBU JETTY</p>
<p>     15-17	   200	 BP</p>
<p>     28-30	   200	 Indoil</p>
<p>    SUB TOTAL:     400</p>
<p>LOADING FROM BALIKPAPAN (KALIMANTAN, BORNEO)  </p>
<p>	8-10	   200	 FEI</p>
<p>     12-14	   200	 FEI</p>
<p>     23-25	   160	 Indoil</p>
<p>     23-25	    40	 Pacific Petroleum</p>
<p>     27-29	   114	 Indoil</p>
<p>     27-29	    86	 Itochu</p>
<p>    SUB TOTAL:     800</p>
<p>    TOTAL	  3,800</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-8703082) lin</p>
